---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Helix Training handles information you share through this website." robots="noindex,follow" hideFooterCta>
  <div class="container prose" style="padding-block: var(--s2)">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <!-- SETUP: Kathy reviews this. It describes what the site actually does. If she adds tools (GA4, Meta Pixel), the wizard updates it. -->
    <p><em>Last updated: 2026-09-27</em></p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send a message through the contact form, we receive the name, email, phone number, and message you type. We use it to reply to you and, if you ask about training, to keep track of the conversation in our member system (PushPress).</p>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies and does not track you across sites. It tells us which pages people visit so we can improve the site.</p>
    <h2>Third-party content</h2>
    <p>Some pages load content from other companies: Google Maps (the map), Google Fonts (the typeface), PushPress (the class calendar and sign-up pages), and a Google review widget. Those services may set their own cookies or record that your browser loaded them, under their own privacy policies.</p>
    <h2>Booking and payments</h2>
    <p>Class booking and payments happen on PushPress, our member management system. PushPress's own <a href="https://www.pushpress.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">privacy policy</a> applies there.</p>
    <h2>Health information</h2>
    <p>Please don't share medical details through the contact form. We'll talk about your history in person before your first class.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Want us to delete your information? Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
